              "content": "Blended forecast that stitches short-term (~15 days), subseasonal (up to 6 weeks), and seasonal (up to 6 months) horizons into a single continuous timeline, returning the raw ensemble members (~31 values per date).\n\nPick exactly the variables you need. Optional ~1 km downscaling for select variables.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
