        {
          "id": "d87eecf2-27fd-407f-8b9a-41f16cdf0590",
          "name": "Stitched forecast — statistics (mean + quantiles)",
          "request": {
            "name": "Stitched forecast — statistics (mean + quantiles)",
            "description": {
              "content": "Statistical aggregations (mean plus configurable quantiles) over the\nstitched ensemble, with optional temporal aggregation.\n\nTemporal aggregation is variable-aware: precipitation and evaporation\nare **summed**; temperature, humidity, and wind are **averaged** before\nstatistics are computed.\n\n- `daily` → dates like `2025-01-15`\n- `weekly` → ISO weeks like `2025-W03` (Mon–Sun, complete weeks plus the current week)\n- `monthly` → months like `2025-01` (complete calendar months plus the current month)\n\nFor weekly and monthly granularity the response also includes the\n**current (in-progress) period**: days that have already elapsed use\nobserved history values and the remaining days use the forecast, so the\nperiod reflects the full calendar week/month rather than only its\nremaining forecast days. The `current_period` response object states\nwhich period this is and where the observed/forecast boundary lies.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "forecast",
                "statistics"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "lat",
                  "value": "<double>",
                  "description": "(Required) Latitude coordinate in decimal degrees."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "lon",
                  "value": "<double>",
                  "description": "(Required) Longitude coordinate in decimal degrees."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "var",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Weather variable(s). Supports comma-separated values (`var=temp_mean,precipitation`) or repeated parameters (`var=temp_mean&var=precipitation`). If omitted, all available variables are returned.\n"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "var",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Weather variable(s). Supports comma-separated values (`var=temp_mean,precipitation`) or repeated parameters (`var=temp_mean&var=precipitation`). If omitted, all available variables are returned.\n"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "start_date",
                  "value": "<date>",
                  "description": "Start date (inclusive) in `YYYY-MM-DD` format."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "end_date",
                  "value": "<date>",
                  "description": "End date (inclusive) in `YYYY-MM-DD` format."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "use_downscaling",
                  "value": "true",
                  "description": "Apply ~1 km downscaling when available."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
